[[8,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Drain the air conditioner coolant circuit\n\n                                          <a href=\"#/2428833\">0010T84</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429258\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          \n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429681\">7055B66</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429684\">7055B91</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429398\">5530B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429401\">5530B52</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429055\">1060G90</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428988\">1016B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Remove the valve rocker arms.</p><p>2. Remove the hydraulic tappets.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2052534.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Lubricate with engine oil and refit the\nhydraulic tappets in their seatings.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Position the hydraulic tappets\nwith the oil passage hole facing towards the outside of the bottom\ncylinder head: this position puts this hole in communication with\nthe oil channel present in the bottom cylinder head.</p></aside><p>Place the valve rocker arms back in their\nhousings.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428988\">1016B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429055\">1060G90</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429401\">5530B52</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429398\">5530B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429684\">7055B91</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429681\">7055B66</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          \n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429258\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Fill the air conditioner coolant circuit\n\n                                          <a href=\"#/2428833\">0010T84</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"]]